# Deny by default. Both Dockerfiles need exactly these inputs.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!src/**
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile.dev
!docker/Dockerfile.prod
# Never admit credentials or generated files even under an allowed directory.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
